Zero point energy                ...      0.50548548 Eh     317.20 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01983553 Eh      12.45 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
